		// Beeswax melted for a candle mould, one portion a lump - a mould of four candles
		// takes twelve, the three a candle vanilla's pot recipe does. As tallow-molten.json,
		// one recipe per number of pot slots used, and no comments between them.
		//
		// Each also takes an optional dye - any of vanilla's, a tenth of a litre a serving
		// - which colours the wax (WaxPotPatch stamps it on). A dye takes a pot slot.
		//
		// The dyes are named one by one, not as game:dye-*: the handbook's
		// "created by" section dereferences a null for a wildcard that matches
